{"ticker":"SOUN","updated":"2026-10-23T07:54:17Z","profile":{"longName":"SoundHound AI, Inc.","shortName":"SoundHound AI, Inc.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Application","country":"United States","website":"https://www.soundhound.com","fullTimeEmployees":954,"marketCap":1998504704,"trailingPE":null,"forwardPE":-45.0,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":9.835161,"pegRatio":null,"targetMeanPrice":12.57143,"targetHighPrice":17.0,"targetLowPrice":6.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":7,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":0.45,"earningsGrowth":null,"grossMargins":0.42294997,"operatingMargins":-0.75925004,"profitMargins":-0.6745,"totalRevenue":203200000,"beta":2.863,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":19.09,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":4.385,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NGM","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"SoundHound AI, Inc. provides independent voice artificial intelligence (AI) solutions that enables businesses across the automotive, TV, IoT, and customer service industries to deliver conversational experiences to customers in the United States, Korea, France, Japan, Germany, and internationally. The company offers Houndify platform, which provides a suite of Houndify tools to help brands build conversational voice assistants, such as Application Programming Interfaces (API) for text and voice queries, support for custom commands, extensive library of content domains, inclusive software development kit platforms, collaboration capabilities, diagnostic tools, and built-in analytics; SoundHound Chat AI, a voice assistant with integrated generative AI that integrates with knowledge domains, pulling real-time data, such as weather, sports, stocks, flight status, restaurants, and other data; and SoundHound Smart Answering, which offers customer establishments the option to build an easy to use custom AI-powered voice assistant. It also provides CaiNET software that uses machine learning to enhance how domains work together to handle complex queries; CaiLAN software that arbitrates responses, so users get answers from the right domain; Dynamic Interaction, a real-time multimodal customer service interface; Smart Ordering, which offers an easy-to-understand voice assistant for restau","summary_zh":"SoundHound AI, Inc. 提供獨立的語音人工智慧 (AI) 解決方案，使汽車、電視、物聯網和客戶服務行業的企業能夠為美國、韓國、法國、日本、德國和國際客戶提供對話體驗。該公司提供 Houndify 平台，該平台提供了一套 Houndify 工具來幫助品牌構建對話式語音助手，例如用於文字和語音查詢的應用程式介面（API）、自訂指令的支援、廣泛的內容域庫、包容性軟體開發套件平台、協作功能、診斷工具和內建分析；智慧應答，為客戶機構提供建構易於使用的客製化人工智慧語音助理的選項。它還提供 CaiNET 軟體，該軟體使用機器學習來增強域協同處理複雜查詢的方式； CaiLAN 軟體可以仲裁響應，以便用戶從正確的域獲得答案；動態交互，實時多模式客戶服務界面；智能點餐，為餐廳提供簡單易懂的語音助手","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"軟體 - 應用程式","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":12.454,"h":12.65,"l":12.045,"c":12.11,"v":52018800},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":12.19,"h":12.69,"l":11.92,"c":12.02,"v":69505800},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":12.1,"h":12.33,"l":11.86,"c":11.91,"v":51890500},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":12.07,"h":12.76,"l":12.07,"c":12.53,"v":64222100},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":12.7,"h":13.03,"l":12.19,"c":13.02,"v":81674900},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":12.59,"h":13.52,"l":12.14,"c":13.42,"v":81091900},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":13.615,"h":13.7,"l":12.65,"c":12.74,"v":65324500},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":12.72,"h":13.44,"l":12.66,"c":13.29,"v":86769700},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":13.54,"h":14.41,"l":12.81,"c":14.26,"v":95630500},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":14.48,"h":15.53,"l":14.02,"c":15.29,"v":112646300},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":15.025,"h":15.26,"l":14.64,"c":14.85,"v":67708300},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":15.09,"h":15.19,"l":13.91,"c":14.05,"v":74698800},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":14.045,"h":14.89,"l":13.92,"c":14.58,"v":61722300},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":14.39,"h":14.675,"l":14.11,"c":14.12,"v":46682300},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":14.36,"h":15.21,"l":14.04,"c":14.19,"v":74520600},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":14.34,"h":14.72,"l":13.74,"c":14.69,"v":66617800},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":14.685,"h":15.51,"l":14.305,"c":15.12,"v":83347300},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":15.6,"h":16.25,"l":14.77,"c":15.63,"v":84564900},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":15.66,"h":16.62,"l":15.61,"c":16.